# Proto layout

- `protos/<product>/<domain>/`: `models.proto`, `filters.proto`, `<domain>.proto` or `<domain>_service.proto`.
- Entities in `models.proto`. Filters in `filters.proto`. RPCs in the service file.
- Import existing models. Do not duplicate enums.

```protobuf
syntax = "proto3";
package product.domain;

import "product/domain/models.proto";
import "google/protobuf/timestamp.proto";
```

Format every message as a multiline block, including empty messages. Put each field on its own line below its summary. Use the same layout inside a oneof.
